{% doc %}
  Outputs "hidden" when a product must not be listed (search, collections, home cards) and nothing otherwise (D-092, D-095):
  1. a product priced at zero, which is not sold on its own (D-070);
  2. an IBO pack (product type Packs), unless the shopper is signed in as an IBO. An IBO is Exigo customer type 3 (customer
     metafield Exigo.CustomerTypeId, written by the Exigo connector). A customer whose type is not written yet counts as an
     IBO by the customer tag IBO. Type 2 is not an IBO (D-097), whatever the tag says.
  layout/theme.liquid uses rule 2 to show "Product Not Found" on a pack's own address. The enrolment pages are not affected.

  @param {product} product - The product to check

  @example
  {% capture lp_hidden %}{% render 'lp-search-hidden', product: item %}{% endcapture %}
{% enddoc %}
{%- liquid
  if product.price_max == 0 and product.gift_card? == false
    echo 'hidden'
  elsif product.type == 'Packs'
    assign exigo_type = customer.metafields.Exigo.CustomerTypeId.value | default: customer.metafields.Exigo.CustomerTypeId | append: '' | strip
    assign is_ibo = false
    if exigo_type == '3'
      assign is_ibo = true
    elsif exigo_type == blank and customer.tags contains 'IBO'
      assign is_ibo = true
    endif
    unless is_ibo
      echo 'hidden'
    endunless
  endif
-%}
